# NOTE (2026-09-06): scripts/page-parity.mjs and scripts/sync-check.mjs used to
# be listed here, because prettier rewrites their quoting and that put the sites
# carrying them into DRIFT. Ignoring them never actually held the line: the
# ignore entries were never propagated consistently, so a `prettier --write` in
# presacademy and mas-monograms reformatted their copies anyway. Both files were
# formatted here in one family-wide pass instead, and every repo took the
# formatted bytes. Prettier is now a fixed point on them, so a format run can no
# longer open a drift. Do NOT re-add them: leaving them formatted and unignored
# is what makes the two checks agree.

# prettier-plugin-astro cannot parse a <script is:inline> nested inside a
# template expression (`{cond && (<script>...</script>)}`): it reads the
# script body's braces as expression delimiters and throws a SyntaxError. All
# three files use that pattern deliberately (the script only ships when the
# feature is on), so they are formatted by hand. Revisit when the plugin
# handles it.
